  <item>
    <title>张雪机车：靠热爱过一生真的很精彩！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69ccff8fb977fb2c47d8501b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69ccff8fb977fb2c47d8501b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 11:22:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不同于出人头地的草根逆袭故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>张雪让人感动在于</span></p><span></span><p><span>他那份</span><strong><span>纯粹的热爱</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“我就喜欢摩托车，喜欢的不得了那种”</span></p><span></span><p><span>年轻时候死缠烂打记者，乘着破摩托车一遍遍摔倒在土坑上</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>像极了疯子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>中年时候明明可以在凯越养老，净身出户非要搞发动机</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>像极了傻子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这样一个疯子傻子</span></p><span></span><p><span>在车跑赢的时候痛哭落泪，兴奋的挥舞国旗</span></p><span></span><p><span>那份真挚让人跟着边哭边笑</span></p><span></span><p><span>感动过后，开始思考</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我热爱的的是什么？我这一生想为之奋斗的是什么？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我想走上哪条路的驱动一定是感性随心的，后面理性会帮你在路口做选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以先想做成什么让你觉得贼牛逼贼爽？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们很多时候都停在 权衡这件事能不能做成</span></p><span></span><p><span>他会觉得我一定可以做成，他就只想着怎么做成</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>不着急、不害怕、不要脸</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>敢想、敢做、用心</span></strong><u><strong><span>做</span></strong></u></p><span></span><p><span>做热爱的事，这辈子一定是幸福满足的</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们也能不负热爱~不负此生~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsuh98FosHWClQ8ranHi00XBSqUk.jpeg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c49bdd910765b8ad7f4021/lqHtXSK5ZlXJgizH0Px5bbm3Fcoz.m4a" length="9884583" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:10:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjixqkR9h1ie8do0VC8xLaqXuGIn.jpg"/>
