  <item>
    <title>《道德经》当代实用职场修炼指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68be4ce99eb4a493004fee84</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68be4ce99eb4a493004fee84</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Sep 2025 04:47:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天分享一本今年对我影响最大的书</span></p><span></span><p><span>《正道》-冯唐讲透道德经成事智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期按认知+行动两部分谈起</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后链接到职场做人做事</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论你处在哪种生活和工作状态</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝愿你都能找到内心的平静</span></p><span></span><p><span>做成你内心真正想做成的那件事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第一部分 认知</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>篇章1 致虚守静</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><u><em><span>“致虚极，守静笃。万物并作，吾以复观。”</span></em></u></p><span></span><blockquote><span>不要做那么多，去做最关键的、最能抓得住的、你认为最重要的事</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>按捺住自己那颗因为人性想要马上去做什么事的心，安静、积极地思考</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我是个处理器，我看着身边的一切，看到几个轮回之后，就是人世间的规律</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不着急、不害怕、不要脸，对时间的态度，对结果的态度，对他评的态度</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>守住自己的事情，才是让你能体验到精彩不精彩的决定性因素</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>篇章2 祸福相依</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><u><em><span>“祸兮福之所倚；福兮祸之所伏。孰知其极？”</span></em></u></p><span></span><blockquote><span>福兮祸兮，两者相继相生，本质其实区别不大，重要的是摆正自己的态度</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>人性的愚蠢在于，人不应该那么高兴，不该那么丧气</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不用管福祸，先管好在福祸漩涡中的自己</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>做一个见过世面的人，不张牙舞爪</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>你的能量有更好的用处，不要用在过度担心福祸上面</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场1 如何保持职场健康</span></strong><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="827">13:47</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>好死不如赖活着</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不要给生命增加太多的附属物，这些附属物实际上都是生命的累赘</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>树立一面你一生的欲望之旗，然后放手去追逐它，用它灭掉其他欲望</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>得不到的就得不到了，得到了就受着</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>吃好、睡好、干好</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场2 承压能力决定你事业的上限 </span></strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>宠辱只是状态，平稳更有价值</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>尽量实事求是，就能接近宠辱不惊</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>天下没有所谓太大的事，即使是真的大事，慌也没用，慌也不如不慌。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>麻烦是工作的日常，矛盾是人际的日常</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>第二部分 行动</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>篇章1 千里之行 </span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><u><em><span>“千里之行，始于足下”“慎终如始，则无败事”“图难于其易，为大于其细”</span></em></u></p><span></span><blockquote><span>适合你竞争的地方就是起点</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>做，就是一脚把自己踢出去</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我是个战士，坚持一下</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>庖丁解牛，目的是把牛解了，而不是砍大骨头</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>篇章2 自胜者强 </span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><u><em><span>“知人者智，自知者明。胜人者有力，自胜者强。”</span></em></u></p><span></span><blockquote><span>知错就改，看到自己的问题，接受事实，然后去改，就叫自胜</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>自知，正确地判断自己现在的状态、未来的潜力</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>圣人不病，以其病病，是以不病</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>像壮士断腕一样一刀砍掉自己人性中最愚蠢之处</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场1 面对跟你不同三观、不同做事方法的人，你怎么看？</span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>和光同尘，包容共存</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场2 女性打破天花板需要注意什么？</span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>不要过分仁慈，过分仁慈是对整体价值的破坏</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>职场3 年轻人如何脱颖而出？</span></strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1683">28:03</a></span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>一个正常运营的公司，它一定有你可学的地方</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不要上来就觉得任何老板都是傻逼</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c49bdd910765b8ad7f4021/lq8IJ5jAnP4P1WYnOQDxFAt2Nwdd.m4a" length="29331410" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:13</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjixqkR9h1ie8do0VC8xLaqXuGIn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>烦人的小破事 快滚开我的大脑！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a9e6c7293471fed41c6806</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a9e6c7293471fed41c6806</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Aug 2025 18:03:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我是一个很容易被小事影响的人</span></p><span></span><p><span>杂七杂八的小事会控制不住萦绕在我脑子里</span></p><span></span><p><span>焦虑别人会怎么看我</span></p><span></span><p><span>担心未来要应对的某件事</span></p><span></span><p><span>越是关注别人，在意结果</span></p><span></span><p><span>越是无法做好自己，忽略真正要做的事</span></p><span></span><p><span>读了和田秀树《可是我还是很在意》</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我成功赶走脑中烦人的小破事</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期分享给大家</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿我们都能成为更自由、更轻松的人！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>【在意别人目光】~【不想给别人添麻烦】</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>即使有一个人这么想，也绝不代表其他人会这么想</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>价值观只是一个相对的东西</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>这些小事只有你在意</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>大家真正讨厌一个人，是因为这个人做出了让大家真正讨厌的事</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>被嫌弃一点也没关系</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>会求助，就需要能够期待别人的善意</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>我们在有求对方时，也可能会给对方带来某些价值</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>人其实你根本不知道对方心里想什么</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>【对未来的不安】~【正确地错误观】</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>如果对未来的不安感到不断膨胀，当务之急应该确定某件事情发生的概率</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>不安也不全然是坏事</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>担心事情做不好，不妨想一想如果做好的话能有多少好处</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>觉得正是得意于自己才有这样的结果，也并不是什么坏事</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>能让失败的经历服务于当下的人，肯定能够不断进步</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>默念咒语：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关你屁事！关我屁事！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>(我怎么样关你屁事，你怎么看我管我屁事)</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>不着急！不害怕!不要脸!</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>(对时间的态度,对结果的态度, &nbsp;对他评的态度)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c49bdd910765b8ad7f4021/lselhfRcICt9CPRamQL5wuxcYHEX.m4a" length="19559225" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjixqkR9h1ie8do0VC8xLaqXuGIn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>那些激励过我的女性力量【全英文】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688b55c2edf3fa32d57573f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688b55c2edf3fa32d57573f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Jul 2025 11:42:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期用英文分享曾经打动过我的女性力量发声</span></p><span></span><p><span>《芭比》里“女人为什么要活的这么累”的觉醒时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>你必须要这样，你必须要那样</span></p><span></span><p><span>社会的规则牢牢束缚女人应该是什么样</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我们必须时刻做到无可挑剔</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>可事与愿违我们又总是一错再错</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>It is literally impossible to be a woman!</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>《了不起的麦瑟尔夫人》里那段“我想要更精彩人生”的脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span>她说：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>I want a big life.</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>I want to experience everything.</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>I want to break every single rule there is.</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>有野心的女人会缺乏吸引力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>呸！</span></p><span></span><p><span>真正没有吸引力是</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>Waiting around for something to happen</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>没有勇气去争取属于你本来的人生</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>看着Doechii挥着格莱美奖杯一字一句喊着:</span></p><span></span><p><span>别让任何人定义你</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>You are exactly who you need to be ！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>希拉里在2016年败选演讲里娓娓道来：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Never doubt that you are valuable and powerful</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>你值得每一个机会！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Viola Davis让我们大声喊出 </span><em><strong><span>I'm worth it!</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>Sheryl Lee Ralph在65岁得到艾美奖时盯着屏幕和姑娘们说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>当你看向镜子，你一定要爱镜子里的那个人！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>You better love what you see!</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>拿了一手烂牌Niecy Nash拿到艾美奖时，</span></p><span></span><p><span>颤抖地喊出：老娘最想感谢我自己!</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>Gone girl with your bad set</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>You did that！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>中英文链接：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 电影《芭比》：觉醒时刻</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11f421B73X?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV11f421B73X?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>2、格莱美奖得主Doechii：你可以做任何事！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kd5GzeEbi?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Kd5GzeEbi?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>3、电视剧《了不起的麦瑟尔夫人》：我想要精彩的人生！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1R8411Z7oJ?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1R8411Z7oJ?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>4、希拉里 2016年败选演讲：永远不要怀疑自己</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U9x9edErw?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1U9x9edErw?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>5.Viola Davis：我值得！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18rK3z1EF4?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV18rK3z1EF4?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>6.Sheryl Lee Ralph：爱镜子里的你</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nmqLY2Ekq?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nmqLY2Ekq?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>7.Niecy Nash：我最想感谢自己</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EGmwY8EuW?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1EGmwY8EuW?vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
