    <title>大人不可以哭 世界没有留给大人可以哭泣的地方</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6874e0c560f8f77d4072ae1f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6874e0c560f8f77d4072ae1f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Jul 2025 10:51:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>哭着读完NINI的两本漫画</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《想在天气好时去海边》和《带壳的牡蛎是大人的心脏》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>很多情节会想起韩剧《苦尽柑来遇见你》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>细腻的笔触勾勒出漫画里的故事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>触动了我记忆里的一些苦涩</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>仿佛被一个温柔的拥抱轻轻接住</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>读完会收获很多感动</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>把这份带着咸涩的感动</span><br><span>分享给每一个</span><br><span>正在学着当大人的你</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>【关于大人的梦想】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">00:02:53</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>小孩好像有很多选择</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>选择成为想要的成为的人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>大人没有选择</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>只能成为大人</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>外婆在海里游</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>妈妈在地上跑</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>我才能在天上飞</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>*****************************</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【贫穷的苦涩】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">00:08:08</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>妈妈习惯用猪肉来衡量一切</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一斤猪肉是十块钱</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一斤蝴蝶酥是半斤猪肉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>一盒口香糖是一斤猪肉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>父母总是惦记他们没能给予的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>孩子却总想着他们没能得到的</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>*****************************</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【脆弱的大人】<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">00:14:10</a></span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>牡蛎用坚硬的石头、棍棒、怎么砸都砸不碎的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>用一把小刀就可以轻松地打开</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>看起来坚强的、似乎从来不会难过的我的妈妈</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>其实拥有和牡蛎一样的缝隙</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>厚厚的时间的灰尘和储存太久的眼泪是大人的味道</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfC9A59ZG6ZSeVs_dPMi4dKJ9L6.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c49bdd910765b8ad7f4021/lkZ4Qsm6fjT4GBeXCeonD_uviKpk.m4a" length="19554420" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:20:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjixqkR9h1ie8do0VC8xLaqXuGIn.jpg"/>
