  <item>
    <title>这个夏天我们选择轻轻松松 去生活！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686f9c4560f8f77d40d88792</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686f9c4560f8f77d40d88792</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 11:04:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>很喜欢日剧《凪的新生活》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小凪在风平浪静闲暇的夏天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>慢慢褪去酸涩的壳</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>那个刷成黄色小风扇吹出凉风</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>一阵温柔拂面 那样治愈</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>31岁生日</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>汀汀送给了自己一份特别的礼物：暑假</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>她像一只背着笨重乌龟壳的小兔子</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>用冲刺的速度慌忙奔跑了两年</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>积累了太多疲惫和伤痛</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>满身伤痕的汀汀决定</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>给伤口一个愈合的假期</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>休息好了</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>再出发</span></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span>***********************************</span></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>戈戈最近的糟心事一件接一件</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>水光针打出结节，换汇钱被骗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不断地转念和积极的人待在一起</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>紧绷的她让自己变得轻松起来</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>甚至有了低谷上升的感觉</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>“无所谓” 的心态</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>反倒莫名其妙开了个大单</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>不禁感叹 相信相信的力量</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>暑假总有结束的一天</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>电视剧的结尾</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>小凪 回到都市继续生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>汀汀 会重启牛马生活</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>戈戈 会又碰到糟心事</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>也许 明天仍会下雨</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>但</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>这个 夏天充盈过我</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>这个 当下我是轻松快乐的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>就已经足够幸福美好</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>希望我们都长出</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>不怕被雨淋湿的轻盈翅膀</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnjpO5BMFzj08L7LPJn9Ud_jMYNO.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c49bdd910765b8ad7f4021/lmhqqPuQm3YwjDrPANRfb9qRY-mf.m4a" length="91459342" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:15</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fke9bJ08A768p86iZzyHanU5a5U6.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>不再依赖你  我才开始真正强大</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68331137dce640bfddbb9fb1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68331137dce640bfddbb9fb1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 25 May 2025 12:49:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>汀汀和男朋友有了一次冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span>爆哭一晚之后</span></p><span></span><p><span>她突然 &nbsp;生出很多力量</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>&gt;&gt;我不能再那么依赖你！！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>&gt;&gt;我必须要坚强起来！！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>&gt;&gt;我原来并没有那么脆弱！！</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>戈戈和汀汀顺着聊起来</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="921">15:21</a> 关系中依赖的中庸之道</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> 让我们被“摄魂"的 &nbsp;经前综合征PMS</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1936">32:16</a> 中医气血对我们的启发</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2522">42:02</a> 一有矛盾，我们就不是完美伴侣了？</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">52:52</a> &nbsp;时代赋予了选择权 &nbsp;我们却变得虚无</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3834">01:03:54</a> 你会选择和自己谈恋爱吗</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4269">01:11:09</a> 我不再乖巧懂事后 &nbsp;人生并没有那么糟糕</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>戈戈最后和自己说：</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>要不往前走，要不往后走，绝对不可以在原地停</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><span>不管选择是什么</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>祝福这位勇敢的女士</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>一定要幸福啊！</span></strong></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/66c49bdd910765b8ad7f4021/lm5QFYsH7ZnptopzVCDEDmRNdTxh.m4a" length="74115055" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:16:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjixqkR9h1ie8do0VC8xLaqXuGIn.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
