    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>从小到大 汀汀都很羡慕</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>讲一口流利英语的人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>那些人在她眼里闪闪发光</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>汀汀很擅长考试</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>英文考试总是拿高分</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>但她就是讲不出一口流利的英文</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>她开始反思 </span><em><span>一定是哪里出了问题</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><u><span>这期是 汀汀最近两年英语口语学习的总结</span></u></li><span>  </span><li><span>希望能对你有所帮助</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>我们一起加油 讲一口流利的英语！</span></strong></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><strong><span>去见见更广阔的世界！</span></strong></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><strong><span>............................................................................</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>学习总结：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>一、错误的思维--错误的行动</span></strong></em></p><span></span><blockquote><u><span>学语文的方法学英语</span></u></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><u><span>越难得材料越能提升我的能力</span></u></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><u><span>学不好都是别人的原因</span></u></blockquote><span></span><p><em><strong><span>二、正确的思维--正确的行动</span></strong></em></p><span></span><blockquote><span>1）我是怎么开口说人话的</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><u><em><span>重复+语境+有趣输入+交互</span></em></u></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2）方法推荐</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><u><em><span>100LS+大量听力+对话练习+灵活调整</span></em></u></blockquote><span></span><p><em><span>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;推荐学习材料&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;</span></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>方法论：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>书籍 张同完《我在100天内自学英语 翻转人生》</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>B站 罗肖尼 </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tf4y1s7NN/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tf4y1s7NN/?share_source=copy_web&amp;vd_source=3805c1b18e902d2b812f852cb345e8d5"><span>【【高能干货】这个视频将会颠覆你对英语学习的认知——听说篇】</span></a></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>APP：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>100LS练习：【小鹦看看】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>听力：【每日英语听力】</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>自用素材：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>100LS：【绝望主妇】</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>听力：【English Pod】</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmXYYFD9DOBa8fgbVJXBxHfiWAsL.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
